<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">- Cishingini Agwara Kambari [asg]</book>
  <para style="toc3">Ez</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezira</para>
  <para style="toc1">Katagarda ke Ezira</para>
  <para style="mt1">Katagarda ke Ezira</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuɓa̱yuwa̱</para>
  <para style="im">A̱ ciya̱ kuyeve ku vuza na u ɗanai katagarda ka nampa ba. I ta̱ e kusheshe a ɗana ta̱ katagarda ke Ezira ka a̱ a̱ya̱ amangatawa̱na̱shi n amangere (440) kafu a matsa Yesu. Arabali a katagarda ka nampa ka lyaꞋa ta̱ kelime a̱ ubuta̱ u na katagarda ka Arabali ka shamgbai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kukiye ku Ka̱shile ki ta̱ punu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ki ili i na i gita̱i a katagarda ka. Ka̱shile ka yaꞋan ta̱ ili i nanlo adama a na u shatangu kadanshi ka na u yaꞋain a̱ una̱ u keneki Irimiya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na ɗa ili ya i gita̱i punu:</para>
  <para style="imi">1 Ka̱tsura̱ ka̱ ugiti ka aza a Yahuda a na i a iɗika i tsugbashi ɗa uta̱i a Babila tsu na Sayiru mogono ma Pashiya ma dansai.</para>
  <para style="imi">2 O doku a maꞋasakai A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin ɗa erengi a ɗa, ɗa kpamu a cikpai Ka̱shile punu a Urushelima.</para>
  <para style="imi">3 Ana a̱ya̱ o yoku a lazai, ka̱tsura̱ ka aza a Yahuda o yoku o bonoi a Urushelima o tsugono tsu Ezira.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ezira kaɗani kaꞋa keyevi ka̱ wila̱ u Musa. A̱yi ɗa u ɓa̱nka̱i uma a lapulasaka kuyongo ku le ku anana n makpa, adama a na o tono wila̱ u le, ɗaɗa uzuwakpani n Ka̱shile n kuyongo ku ni n uma a̱ ni aza a Isaraila.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ili i na yi punu</para>
  <para style="io1">Uboni wu ugiti a ugbashi 1:1--2:70</para>
  <para style="io1">O doku a maꞋasakai A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin ɗa erengi a ɗa u Ka̱shile 3:1--6:22</para>
  <para style="io1">Ezira u bonoi koɓolo n aza o yoku a iɗika yi ugbashi 7:1--10:44</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mogono Sayiru u danai aza a ugbashi o bono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 36:22-23">2 Ar 36:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka̱ ugiti ko tsugono tsu Sayiru mogono ma iɗika i Pashiya, ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u shatangi kadanshi ka na u danai a̱ una̱ u keneki Irimiya a̱ ubuta̱ u kusaꞋwa ka̱ɗu ko mogono Sayiru u nekei kadanshi aza a Yahuda o bono. Ɗa mogono ma zuwai a salai ukuna wa ka̱ta̱ kpamu a ɗana u ɗa a uɓon u tsugono ci ni.<verse eid="EZR 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2" />&lt;&lt;Ukuna u na mogono Sayiru ma Pashiya u salai u ɗa na, Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka gaɗi, ke neke mu ta̱ tsugono tsa aduniyan ra̱ka̱, ɗa kpamu u nekei mu ulinga u kumaꞋaka yi kpaꞋa a Urishelima a iɗika i Yahuda. <verse eid="EZR 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3" />Yayi a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ ɗa̱ wu uta̱i a uma a̱ Ka̱shile ki Isaraila? YaꞋan u bono a Urishelima vu na wi a iɗika i Yahuda, u doku u maꞋasaka KpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki Isaraila, Ka̱shile ka na ki a Urishelima. YaꞋan Ka̱shile ka̱ ni ko yongo koɓolo n a̱yi. <verse eid="EZR 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4" />A̱ ubuta̱ u na baci de dem vuza Yahuda u buwai, aza a na i lo ida̱shi ɗevu n a̱yi, a̱ ɓa̱nka̱ yi n azurufa n azanariya, n ucanuku n ili i kuzuwa, n kuneꞋe ku ucigi u ka̱ɗu adama a kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ku na ki a Urishelima.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EZR 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5" />Ɗa anan ganu n aza e Levi n aza e kelime ka iꞋuwa i Yahuda m Bayami, aza a na Ka̱shile ka sawai a̱ɗu e le ɗa kpamu ushuki ku bono a Urishelima a maꞋasaka KpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu ku na ki a Urishelima. <verse eid="EZR 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6" />Aza a na i a̱ ida̱shi ɗevu n aza a Yahuda, a̱ ɓa̱nka̱i le n ucanuku u na a yaꞋin n azurufa n azanariya, n ucanuku u yoku n ili kuzuwa, koɓolo n ki ili i singai n kuneꞋe ku uneki u ka̱ɗu.<verse eid="EZR 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7" />Mogono Sayiru u tuka̱i n ucanuku u na wi u KpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu, u na mogono Nebukadnezaru wishi u pura̱i a Urishelima ɗa u zuwai a kpaꞋa ka̱ a̱ma̱li a̱ ni. <verse eid="EZR 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8" />Ɗa Sayiru mogono ma Pashiya u nekei ucanuku wa ekiye a Mitiredatu kazuwi ku kpaꞋa ku mogono, ɗa u kecei u ɗa. U nekei Sheshibazaru vuza vu kelime va aza a Yahuda. <verse eid="EZR 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9" />Na ɗa ucanuku u na Mogono Sayirus u nekei.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:9">Asasu a gbagbain a azanariya kamangankupa n</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:9">Asasu a gbagbain a na a yaꞋin n azurufa, ka̱kpa̱n (1,000) nu</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:9">Nsasu ma azurufa kamanga n kuci.<verse eid="EZR 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10" />Apara azanariya kamangankupa</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:10">N apara o yoku a azurufa, amangatawa̱na̱shi n kupa (410) n</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:10">Ucanuku u yoku ka̱kpa̱n (1,000).<verse eid="EZR 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11" />Ucanuku wa azanariya n wa azurufa a yawa ta̱ a̱kpa̱n a tawun n amangatawa̱na̱shi (5,400). Sheshibazaru u ta̱wa̱i n ucanuku wa ra̱ka̱ u na a̱ pura̱i aza a na a bankai ugbashi a Babila ɗa o bonokoi u ɗa a Urishelima.<verse eid="EZR 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ka̱bunda̱i ka aza a na o bonoi n ugbashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NEH 7:4-73">Neh 7:4-73</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1" />Nava ɗaɗa ka̱bunda̱i ka uma a na a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i uɓon wu iɗika i Babila ɗa o bonoi a Urishelima n Yahuda. Yaba dem vu le u bono ta̱ a̱ likuci i ni. Ele ɗa aza a na mogono Nebukadnezaru wishi u ɗikai ikaya le a kubana ugbashi. Ɗa muku n le n yongoi a Babila. <verse eid="EZR 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2" />Aza e kelime a na o bonoi n e le, ele ɗa, Zerubabelu n Jesuwa n Nehemiya n Seraya n Relaya n Modikaya m Bilishan, n Misaferetu m Bigawai n Rehum m BaꞋanahu, nava ɗaɗa ula aza a na ishi a banai tsugbashi n ka̱bunda̱i ke le. <verse eid="EZR 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3" />Ntsukaya m Paroshi ele ɗa uma a̱kpa̱n e re n amangatawun n amangatatsunkupa n e re (2,172), <verse eid="EZR 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4" />n Shefatiya ele ɗa, uma amangatawantatsu n amangatatsunkupa n e re (372), <verse eid="EZR 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5" />ntsukaya n Ara, ele ɗa uma amangatawencindere n amangatatsunkupa n a tawun (775), <verse eid="EZR 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6" />ntsukaya n Pahatu-mowabu a kumaci ku Jesuwa n Jowabu ele ɗa uma a̱kpa̱n e re n amangatawunkunla̱i n kupa n e re (2,812). <verse eid="EZR 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7" />Ntsukaya n Elam, ele ɗa uma ka̱kpa̱n n amangatawenre n amangerenkupa n a̱na̱shi (1,254). <verse eid="EZR 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8" />Ntsukaya n Zatu ele ɗa uma amangatawunkuci n amangere n a tawun (945). <verse eid="EZR 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9" />Ntsukaya n Zakai, ele ɗa uma amangatawencindere n amangatatsu (760). <verse eid="EZR 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10" />Ntsukaya m Bani ele ɗa uma amangatawa̱nta̱li n amangere n e re (642). <verse eid="EZR 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11" />Ntsukaya m Bebayi, ele ɗa uma amangatawa̱nta̱li n kamanga n a tatsu (623). <verse eid="EZR 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12" />Ntsukaya n Azagada ele ɗa, uma ka̱kpa̱n n amangatawenre n kamanga n e re (1,222). <verse eid="EZR 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13" />Ntsukaya n Adonikam, ele ɗa uma amangatawa̱nta̱li n amangatatsu n a̱ta̱li (666). <verse eid="EZR 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14" />Ntsukaya m Bigawai, ele ɗa uma a̱kpa̱n e re n amangerenkupa n a̱ta̱li (2,056). <verse eid="EZR 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15" />Ntsukaya n Adini, ele ɗa uma amangatawa̱na̱shi n amangerenkupa n a̱na̱shi (454). <verse eid="EZR 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16" />Ntsukaya n Ataru n vuza na e ci ɗeke Hezekiya, ele ɗa uma amanga̱na̱shinkupa n kula̱i <verse eid="EZR 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17" />Ntsukaya m Bezayi ele ɗa, uma amangatawantatsu n kamanga n a tatsu (323). <verse eid="EZR 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18" />Ntsukaya n Jora ele ɗa, uma amangatawun n kupa n e re (112). <verse eid="EZR 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19" />Ntsukaya n Hashum ele ɗa uma amangatawun n kamanga n a tatsu (123). <verse eid="EZR 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20" />Ntsukaya n Gibiyon, ele ɗa uma amanga̱na̱shinkupa n a tawun. <verse eid="EZR 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21" />Na ɗa uma a na ikaya i le i da̱sa̱ngi likuci-likuci i nampa ele feu o bonoi. Aza a Batalami, ele ɗa uma amangatawun n kamanga n a tatsu (123). <verse eid="EZR 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22" />Aza a Netofa, ele ɗa uma amangerenkupa n a̱ta̱li. <verse eid="EZR 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23" />Aza a Anatotu ele ɗa uma amangatawun n kamanga n kunla̱i (128). <verse eid="EZR 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24" />Aza a Betu-azamavetu ele ɗa, uma amangere n e re. <verse eid="EZR 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25" />Aza a Kiriyatu-jerim n Kepira m Beyarotu ele ɗa, uma amangatawencindere n amangere n a tatsu (743). <verse eid="EZR 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26" />Aza a Rama n Geba ele ɗa, uma amangatawa̱nta̱li n kamanga n ke te (621). <verse eid="EZR 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27" />Aza a Mikamashi ele ɗa, uma amangatawun n kamanga n e re (122). <verse eid="EZR 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28" />Aza a Betelu n Ai, ele ɗa uma amangatawenre n kamanga n a tatsu (223). <verse eid="EZR 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29" />Aza a Nebo, ele ɗa uma amangerenkupa n e re. <verse eid="EZR 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30" />Muku n Magabishi ele ɗa, uma amangatawun n amangerenkupa n a̱ta̱li, (156). <verse eid="EZR 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31" />Aza a Elam vu yoku, ele ɗa uma ka̱kpa̱n n amangatawenre n amangerenkupa n a̱na̱shi (1,254). <verse eid="EZR 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32" />Aza a Harim, ele ɗa uma amangatawantatsu n kamanga (320). <verse eid="EZR 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33" />Aza a Lodu n Hadida n Ono ele ɗa uma amangatawencindere n kamanga n a tawun (725). <verse eid="EZR 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34" />Aza a Jeriko ele ɗa uma amangatawantatsu n amangere n a tawun (345). <verse eid="EZR 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35" />Aza a SenaꞋaha ele ɗa uma a̱kpa̱n a tatsu n amangatawa̱nta̱li n kamangankupa (3,630). <verse eid="EZR 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36" />Na ɗa ula a anan Ganu a na o bonoi n ugbashi. Muku n Jedaya vu kpaꞋa ku Jesuwa ele ɗa uma amangatawunkuci n amangatatsunkupa n a tatsu (973). <verse eid="EZR 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37" />Ntsukaya n Imeru ele ɗa uma ka̱kpa̱n n amangerenkupa n e re (1,052). <verse eid="EZR 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38" />Ntsukaya n Pashuru ele ɗa uma ka̱kpa̱n n amangatawenre n amangere n e cindere (1,247). <verse eid="EZR 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39" />Ntsukaya n Harim ele ɗa uma ka̱kpa̱n n kupa n e cindere (1,017). <verse eid="EZR 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40" />Na ɗa ula aza e Levi a na o bonoi n ugbashi. Ntsukaya n Jesuwa n Kadimiyelu, vu kpaꞋa ku Hodeva, ele ɗa uma amangatatsunkupa n a̱na̱shi. <verse eid="EZR 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41" />Aza a ishipa ntsukaya n Asafa ele ɗa uma amangatawun n kamanga n kunla̱i (128). <verse eid="EZR 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42" />Aza a̱ kula̱na̱ utsutsu wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka ntsukaya n Shalum nu ntsukaya n Ateru nu ntsukaya n Talumon nu ntsukaya n Akubu nu ntsukaya n Hatita koɓolo nu ntsukaya n Shobayi, ele ɗa uma amangatawun n kamangankupa n kuci (139). <verse eid="EZR 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43" />Na ɗa ula aza a na i a kuyaꞋan ulinga A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin aza a na o bonoi n ugbashi. Ntsukaya n Ziha nu n Hasufa nu n Tabuwatu, <verse eid="EZR 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44" />nu n Kerosu, nu n Siyaha nu n Padon, <verse eid="EZR 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45" />nu n Lebana nu n Hagaba nu n Akubu, <verse eid="EZR 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46" />nu n Hagabu nu n Shalumayi nu n Hanana, <verse eid="EZR 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47" />nu n Gidelu nu n Gaharu nu n Reyaya, <verse eid="EZR 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48" />nu n Rezin nu n Nekoda nu n Gazamu, <verse eid="EZR 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49" />nu n Uza nu n Pasiya nu n Besayi, <verse eid="EZR 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50" />nu n Asana nu n MeꞋunim nu n Nefusim, <verse eid="EZR 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51" />nu n Babuku nu n Hakufa nu n Harihuru, <verse eid="EZR 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52" />nu n Bazilatu nu n Mehida nu n Harisha, <verse eid="EZR 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53" />nu n Barakosu nu n Sisera nu n Tema, <verse eid="EZR 2:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54" />nu n Neziya, nu n Hatifa. <verse eid="EZR 2:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55" />Na ɗa ula aza a na i a kuyaꞋanka Sulemanu ulinga aza a na o bonoi. Ntsukaya n Sotayi nu n Hasoferetu nu n Peruda, <verse eid="EZR 2:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56" />nu n JaꞋala nu n Darukon nu n Gidelu, <verse eid="EZR 2:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57" />nu n Shefatiya nu n Hatilu nu n Pokeretu-hazebayim nu n Ami. <verse eid="EZR 2:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58" />Ntsukaya ma aza a ulinga wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin ra̱ka̱ n aza a na i a kuyaꞋanka Sulemanu ulinga a na o bonoi n ugbashi. Ele ɗa uma amangatawantatsu n amanga̱na̱shinkupa n e re (392). <verse eid="EZR 2:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59" />Na ɗa ula aza a na uta̱i a̱ likuci i Telu-mela n Telu-haresha n Kerebu n likuci i Adon n Imeru. Ama a fuɗa e yeve iꞋuwa i le ko ikaya i le aza a Isaraila ɗa ba. <verse eid="EZR 2:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60" />Ntsukaya n Delaya nu n Tobiya nu n Nekoda, ele ɗa uma amangatawa̱nta̱li n amangerenkupa n e re (652). <verse eid="EZR 2:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61" />A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kumaci ku anan Ganu, ntsukaya n Hobaya nu n Hakozu nu m Barizilayi vuza vu na u zuwai mekere ma Barizilayi vuza vu Giliyadu, ɗa u ɗikai kula ka akaya a̱ ni <verse eid="EZR 2:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62" />Uma a nampa a ɗa a̱ la̱nsa̱i ula ele a katagarda ka tsumani ka ikaya i le, ama a̱ ciya̱ ula ele ba. Adama a nannai ɗa bonokoi le aza a unata, ɗa utukai le ulinga u tsuganu. <verse eid="EZR 2:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63" />Ɗa gomuna vi iɗika ya u danai le i a kulyaꞋa ilikulyaꞋa i ciɗa i na e nekei Ka̱shile alyuka ba, sai Ganu u yaꞋan ulinga n Yurim n Tumi u la̱nsa̱ kuyeve ku Vuzavaguɗu adama a ka nanlo ka. <verse eid="EZR 2:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64" />Ka̱bunda̱i ka uma ka na ko bonoi a iɗika i Yahuda, ele uma a̱kpa̱n amangere n e re n amangatawantatsu n amangatatsu (42,360). <verse eid="EZR 2:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65" />Kpamu o yongo ta̱ n aza a ulinga ali n a̱ma̱ci a̱kpa̱n e cindere n amangatawantatsu n kamangankupa n e cindere (7,337), n aza a ishipa ali n a̱ma̱ci uma amangatawenre (200). <verse eid="EZR 2:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66" />Ɗa a banai n odoku e le amangatawencindere n kamangankupa n a̱ta̱li (736), nu mkparagi amangatawenre n amangere n a tawun (245). <verse eid="EZR 2:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67" />Arakuma e le kpamu amangatawa̱na̱shi n kamangankupa n a tawun (435), ka̱bunda̱i ka njaki n le ɗaɗa a̱kpa̱n a̱ta̱li n amangatawencindere n kamanga (6,720). <verse eid="EZR 2:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68" />Ana a yawai a kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu a̱ likuci i Urushelima, ɗa aza e kelime a iꞋuwa o yoku a yaꞋin kuneꞋen ku ucigi u ka̱ɗu adama a na a maꞋasaka KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile a̱ uba̱ta̱ u na kishi. <verse eid="EZR 2:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69" />Yaba dem vu le u nekei uteku wu utsura u ni adama u linga wa. Ɗa o ɓolongi azanariya a na a yawai a̱miki kilo amangatawantawun (500), n azurufa kilo a̱kpa̱n e re n amangatawunkunla̱i (2,800) nu ntogu n anan ganu amangatawun (100). <verse eid="EZR 2:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70" />Anan Ganu n aza e Levi n uma a na a buwai n aza a ishipa n aza a a kindi ku utsutsu n aza ulinga a KpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu ɗa a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a̱ likuci i le. Ɗa aza Isaraila a na a buwai o bonoi a̱ likuci i na ikaya i le i da̱sa̱ngi.<verse eid="EZR 2:70" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3" />
  <para style="s1">KumaꞋasaka katalikalyuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1" />Ana wotoi u cindere u shamgbai, ci na ɗe aza Isaraila a̱ da̱sa̱ngu su a̱ likuci i le, ɗa o ɓolongi ra̱ka̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u te a Urushelima. <verse eid="EZR 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2" />Ɗa Jesuwa maku ma Jozadaku n aza a̱ ni anan ganu, n Zerubabelu maku ma Shiyatiyelu koɓolo n otoku ni, a̱ gita̱i kumaꞋasaka katalikalyuka ka̱ Ka̱shile ki Isaraila. A maꞋi katalikalyuka ka adama e kuneꞋen ka alyuka o kusongu, tsu na ka ki uɗani a̱ wila̱ u Musa vuma vu Ka̱shile. <verse eid="EZR 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3" />Ɗa a maꞋasakai katalikalyuka ka a̱ ubuta̱ u na ka kishi, adama a na i ta̱ a kupana wovon wa aza a iɗika ya. Ɗa a yaꞋin kuneꞋen ku kusongu u Vuzavaguɗu usana n kulivi, <verse eid="EZR 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4" />ɗa kpamu a yaꞋin Ka̱ɗiva̱ ka̱ A̱pa̱m tsu na ka ki uɗani. Nu e nekei kuneꞋen ku kusongu ku kanna dem tsu ka̱bunda̱i ka alyuka ka, tsu na a zuwai. <verse eid="EZR 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5" />Ana ka nanlo ko kotsoi ɗa a lyaꞋi kelime n kuneꞋen alyuka o kusongu a kanna dem, n kuneꞋen ku ka̱ɗiva̱ ko wotoi u savu, n ku ka̱ɗiva̱ ka Vuzavaguɗu ka na a zuwai kanna, n ku kuneꞋen kakau ku ucigi u ka̱ɗu u Vuzavaguɗu ku na uma e ci neke. <verse eid="EZR 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6" />Ili i na i ɗikai a kanna ka ugiti ko wotoi u cindere ɗa a̱ gita̱i kuneke kuneꞋe ku kusongu u Vuzavaguɗu. Ama babu na a vara ku kumaꞋa ka̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="EZR 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A̱ gita̱i kumaꞋasaka A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7" />Ɗa uma e nekei ikebe adama a na a tsupa amaꞋi n esheꞋwi. Ɗa kpamu e nekei aza a Sidon n aza a Taya ilikulyaꞋa, n ili i kusoꞋo n maniꞋin ma zaitu, adama a na a̱ tuka̱ n nɗanga n sida a Lebano a mala a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ u na antsu a tsu shamgba a Jopa. A yaꞋan ta̱ ili i nanlo ra̱ka̱ tsu na Sayiru mogono ma pashiya me nekei le una̱. <verse eid="EZR 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8" />A̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko wotoi u ire a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka i re ana a yawai a kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile a Urushelima, Zerubabelu maku ma Shiyatiyelu n Jesuwa maku ma Jozadaku koɓolo n aza ni anan ganu n aza Levi n aza na o bonoi a Urushelima a ubuta̱ u tsugbashi. Ɗa a̱ gita̱i ulinga u kumaꞋa ka a zuwai aza e Levi aza na a yawai a̱ya̱ kamanga a kubana gaɗi, adama a na a̱ la̱na̱ ulinga u kumaꞋasaka KpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="EZR 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9" />Jesuwa koɓolo n muku n ni olobo n aza a̱ ni, Kadimiyelu n muku mo olobo n ni, n muku n Hodaviya n muku n Henadadu aza e Levi a ɗa a̱ la̱na̱i ulinga u kumaꞋa ku KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka. <verse eid="EZR 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10" />Ana a maꞋin a a varai kumaꞋa ka̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu, ɗa anan ganu uta̱i a shamgbai lo nu ntogu n le u uki, yaba dem vu le uɓa̱ni n ishari. Ɗa aza e Levi a na uta̱i a kumaci ku Asafa ele feu uta̱i a shamgbai, yaba dem vu le uɓa̱ni n ugogi. Uta̱ ta̱ adama a na a cikpa Vuzavaguɗu, tsu na a zuwai ali a makyan Dawuda mogono. <verse eid="EZR 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11" />Ɗa aza o yoku a cananai ishipa i kucikpa Vuzavaguɗu, aza o yoku a̱ ku ushuku n a danai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZR 3:11">&lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu vuza kasingai ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 3:11">ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba ko wannai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 3:11">wa aza a Isaraila.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 3:11" />
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 3:11">Ɗa uma ra̱ka̱ a̱ ɗa̱ngusa̱i a̱la̱ka̱tsu n utsura a cikpai Vuzavaguɗu Adama a na a vara ta̱ kumaꞋa ku KpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="EZR 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12" />Ama a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱, n anan ganu n aza e Levi n aza e kelime ka iꞋuwa a na enei KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ku ugiti, ɗa o ɓosoi ka̱da̱wuri ana enei kumiꞋi ku kpaꞋa ka. Aza o yoku tankpamu a̱ ɗa̱ngusa̱i a̱la̱ka̱tsu adama a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱. <verse eid="EZR 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13" />Ali vuza u kufuɗa kuyeve a̱la̱ka̱tsu a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ n a̱ ma̱shi ba, adama a na uma a̱ ɗa̱ngusa̱ ta̱ a̱la̱ka̱tsu n utsura ka̱u ali uma a na i daꞋin a panai.<verse eid="EZR 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4" />
  <para style="s1">Tsurala adama a ulinga u kumaꞋa ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1" />Ana irala ya aza a Yahuda n ya aza a Bayami a panai uma a na bonoi n ugbashi wa i ta̱ a kumaꞋasaka A̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki Israila, <verse eid="EZR 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2" />ɗa a banai u Zerubabelu n aza e kelime a iꞋuwa a danai, &lt;&lt;YaꞋan tsu tsu gbaɓai kaci ci yaꞋan kumaꞋa ka koɓolo, adama a na a̱ tsu feu ci ta̱ o kutono Ka̱shile ka̱ ɗa̱ tsu na yi a kuyaꞋan. Tsu geshe ta̱ ɗe a kuyaꞋanka yi alyuka, ali a ayin o mogono Esarahadon vuza vu Asiriya, a̱yi na u tuka̱i tsu punu na n ida̱shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EZR 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3" />Ama ɗa Zerubabelu n Jesuwa, koɓolo n aza e kelime a iꞋuwa ya aza Israila a danai le, &lt;&lt;Ili i bura ɗa̱ n kumaꞋa ka̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu ba. A̱tsu ɗa koci tsa kuyaꞋanka Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki Isaraila kumaꞋa, tsu na Sayiru mogono ma Pashiya u danai,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EZR 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4" />Ɗa uma a iɗika ya a yaꞋin tsu na a kuyaꞋan a̱ sa̱nka̱ aza a Yahuda a, ɗa kpamu e nekei le wovon adama a na ka̱ta̱ a yaꞋan kumaꞋa ka ba, <verse eid="EZR 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5" />ɗa e nekei aza odoki o mogono ma Pashiya kalyaꞋa adama a na a̱ la̱nga̱sa̱ kusheshe aza a yahuda, a ayin o tsugono tsu Sayiru mogono ma Pashiya, ali a kubana a ayin o tsugono tsu Dariyu mogono.<verse eid="EZR 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Katakarda a kubana u Mogono Atazesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6" />A̱ ugiti u tsugono tsu Ahasuru, irala i ɗanai katagarda a bankai azafada adama aza a na i a̱ ida̱shi a Yahuda n Urushelima. <verse eid="EZR 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7" />Ɗa kpamu a makyan mo tsugono tsu Atazesu, ɗa Bishalam n Mitiredatu n Tabiyelu koɓolo n aza a na a buwai a ɗanakai Atazesu mogono ma Pashiya Katagarda n kelentsu ka aza Aramiya, ɗa e kecekei mogono kaꞋa. <verse eid="EZR 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8" />Ɗa Rehum kovonshi vo osoji n Shimashayi kaɗani, a ɗanai katagarda ka̱ kula̱nga̱su adama a Urushelima a kubana u mogono Atazesu. <verse eid="EZR 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9" />Ɗa kpamu Rehum kovonshi vo osoji n Shimashayi kaɗani n aza e le, azafada nu nkoshi n a̱gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n i gomuna yi uɓon u yoku, uma a Pashiya n aza a Ereku n aza a Babila n aza a Susa vu na vi a iɗika i Elam, <verse eid="EZR 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10" />n kagimi ku uduniya u na vuzagbayin Osanaparu u pura̱i ɗa u zuwai le a̱ da̱sa̱ngu a̱ likuci i Samariya, n kagimi ka uɓon wu upashi u kuyene ku Yufiretus. <verse eid="EZR 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11" />Na ɗa ili i na a ɗanai punu a katakarda ka akaka a, &lt;&lt;Ikya̱shi a kubana u mogono Atazesu. A̱tsu agbashi a na i a̱ ida̱shi a uɓon wu upashi u kuyene ku Yufiretu. <verse eid="EZR 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12" />Ci ciga ta̱ vuzagbayin mogono vu yeve, a na aza a Yahuda a na uta̱i wa̱ nu a̱ kuta̱wa̱ wa̱ a̱tsu, a laza ta̱ a kubana a Urushelima. A maꞋasaka ta̱ ɗe a likuci i gbani-gbani n yi ugbamiwasuvu i nanlo, i ta̱ ɗe o ku kotso kumaꞋa mashilya ma, n a lapulai kumiꞋi ku mashilya ma̱ likuci ma. <verse eid="EZR 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13" />Gogo na, yaꞋan mogono me yeve, ɗa baci uma a nampa o kotsoi kumaꞋasaka mashilya ma, i o doku ku kutsupa utafu ko ikebe i kuꞋuwaka n ku uta̱ka̱ n ucanuku, ko ikebe yi uye ba, nannai va wi ta̱ e kujebe ikebe i na a̱ tsu tuka̱ a kpaꞋa ku tsugono. <verse eid="EZR 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14" />A na wo okpoi ci ta̱ a kulyaꞋasa ili i kefeku ko tsugono, u gaꞋan o goyo mogono a̱ tsu a kinda ba. Ɗaɗa i zuwai ɗa tsu ɗanakai mogono, <verse eid="EZR 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15" />adama a na vu la̱na̱ a katagarda ka tsumani ki ikaya i nu, vi ta̱ a kucina punu a katagarda ka tsumani tsa, na lo va likuci yi ugbamiwasuvu i ɗa. Ali n ayin a cau likuci i nampa ya yi ta̱ a yaꞋansaka ngono n uɓon le ugbamukaci. makyan dem uma a a̱ tsu ka̱na̱ ta̱ mavura, ili i nampa i ɗa i zuwai ɗa a̱ la̱nga̱sa̱i likuci ya. <verse eid="EZR 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16" />Adama a nannai mogono ci ta̱ a kudana wu, ɗa baci vu ka̱sa̱kpa̱i a maꞋasakai likuci ya, ali o kotsoi mashilya ma vi a̱ kuciya̱ upecu u nu u na wi a uɓon wu upashi u kuyene ku Yufiretu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EZR 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17" />Ɗa mogono ma̱ ushuki le, u danai, &lt;&lt;Ikya̱shi a kubana u Rehum kovonshi vo osoji, n Shimashayi kaɗani ka uɓon u nanlo wa, koɓolo n aza e le a na a buwai i a̱ ida̱shi a Samariya, n aza a na a ubuwai i a uɓon wu upashi u kuyene ku Yufiretu. <verse eid="EZR 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18" />Katagarda ka akaka a na i suꞋuki tsu va e keceke tsu ta̱ kaꞋa kpamu a dana ta̱ ili i na yi punu ra̱ka̱ mpa a kupana. <verse eid="EZR 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19" />Ɗa n nekei kadanshi a̱ la̱na̱, ɗa a cinai likuci i nampa ya i yaꞋanka ta̱ ngono ugbamukaci, kpamu o yongo so ta̱ a mavura n vishili a̱ likuci ya. <verse eid="EZR 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20" />A yaꞋan ta̱ ngono n gbagbaꞋin n na a lyaꞋi tsugono a Urushelima, n uɓon u na wi a upashi u kuyene ku Yufiretu, isasai utafu n ikebe i ku uwaka n i ku uta̱ka̱ n ucanuku, n ikebe yi uye. <verse eid="EZR 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21" />Adama a nanai nekei kadanshi ka na a̱ kusa̱nka̱ uma a nampa kulyaꞋa kelime kumaꞋasaka likuci ya, ali a makyan ma na n nekei kadanshi. <verse eid="EZR 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22" />Zukai ka̱ta̱ i la̱nga̱sa̱ makyan ba, adama a na ka̱ta̱ o doku a yaꞋan kula̱nga̱su ku na ka kuzuwa mogono ku namba ili ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EZR 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23" />Gogo lo a na e kecei katagarda ka akaka o mogono Atazesu e kelime ka Rehum n Shimashayi kaɗani n aza e le a na a buwai, ɗa a yaꞋin moloko a kubana wa aza a Yahuda a Urushelima, ɗa a̱ sa̱nka̱i le kuyaꞋan ulinga u kumaꞋa ka n utsura. <verse eid="EZR 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24" />Ta a shamgbatangi ulinga u kumaꞋa ku KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile a Urushelima nannai, ali a kubana a̱ ka̱ya̱ ke i re ko tsugono tsu Dariyu mogono ma Pashiya.<verse eid="EZR 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5" />
  <para style="s1">Katagarda ka Tatenayi a kubana u Dariyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1" />A makyan ma nanlo, keneki Hagai n keneki Zakariya maku ma Ido, a yaꞋin kene n kula ku Ka̱shile a kubana wa aza a Yahuda a na i a̱ ida̱shi a iɗika i Yahuda n Urushelima. Ka̱shile ki Isaraila vuza na wi o tsugono ci le. <verse eid="EZR 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2" />Ɗa Zerubabelu maku ma Shiyatiyelu n Jesuwa maku ma Jozadaku a̱ ɗa̱nga̱i a̱ gita̱i kumaꞋasaka KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ku na ki a Urushelima. Eneki a̱ Ka̱shile a tana o yongoi koɓolo n e le, n a̱ ɓa̱nka̱i le. <verse eid="EZR 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3" />A makyan ma nanlo kpamu ɗa Tatenayi Gomuna vu uɓon wu upashi u kuyene ku Yufiretu, n Shetaru-bozenayi, n aza e le a̱ ta̱wa̱i a Urushelima ɗa ecei a danai,&lt;&lt;Yayi u nekei ɗa̱ kadanshi i maꞋa KpaꞋa ku nampa, ali i ɓolongu ucanuku u nampa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EZR 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4" />Ɗa kpamu ecei le a danai &lt;&lt;Teɗai ula a uma a na i a kuciga kuɗa̱ngusa̱ kumaꞋa ka?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EZR 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5" />Ama utsura u Ka̱shile ka aza a Yahuda wi ta̱ a nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n le. Adama a nannai gomuna n aza a̱ ni a fuɗa a̱ sa̱nka̱ ulinga u kumaꞋa ka ba, ali arabali a yawai u mogono Dariyu, kpamu ushuku le ta̱ punu a katagarda ka akaka a. <verse eid="EZR 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6" />Na ɗa ili i na yi punu akaka a na Tatenayi Gomuna vu uɓon u kapashi ke kuyene ku Yufiretu, n Shetaru-bozenayi n aza a̱ ni nu nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n na mi uɓon u kapashi ke kuyene ku Yufiretu a̱ suꞋuki mogono Dariyu. <verse eid="EZR 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7" />A̱ suꞋuki ni uɗani a danai, &lt;&lt;Ma̱ta̱na̱ a kubana wa̱ nu mogono Dariyu. <verse eid="EZR 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8" />Tsu ciga ta̱ mogono me yeve, a na tsu banai uɓon wa aza Yahuda n ubuta̱ u KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka gbayin. I ta̱ a kumaꞋa ka n atali a gbagbaꞋin a na a lapulai, ɗa kpamu a zuwai nɗanga a kasaka ka. Ulinga wa wi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa kelime kpamu i a kuyaꞋan ɗa n ka̱ɗu kete. <verse eid="EZR 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9" />Ɗa tsu ecei nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n le tsu danai, &lt;Yayi u nekei ɗa̱ kadanshi i lyaꞋa kelime n ulinga wa ali ɗa i ɓolongi ucanuku u nampa?&gt; <verse eid="EZR 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10" />Ɗa kpamu tsu ecei le ula e le, adama a na tsu ɗana ka̱ta̱ tsu dana wu aza a na i aza e kelime e le. <verse eid="EZR 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11" />Ushuki tsu a danai, &lt;A̱ tsu aza a ulinga a̱ Ka̱shile ka na ka yaꞋin gaɗi n iɗika ɗa, kpamu ci ta̱ a kumaꞋasaka KpaꞋa ku na a maꞋi ɗe n a̱ya̱ a̱bunda̱i a na a lazai, kpaꞋa ku na mogono ma gbayin mo yoku mi Isaraila ma maꞋi ali u kotsoi. <verse eid="EZR 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12" />Ama adama a na ikaya i tsu i zuwa ta̱ Ka̱shile wupa, ɗa u nekei le ekiye a Nebukanezaru mogono ma Babila, vuza vu Kalidiya. A̱yi ɗa vuza na u la̱nga̱sa̱i kpaꞋa ka, ɗa u pura̱i uma a kubana ugbashi a iɗika i Babila.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:8-12">2 Ng 25:8-12</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:17-20">2 Ar 36:17-20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:12-15">Ir 51:12-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EZR 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13" />Ama a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka̱ ugiti ko tsugono tsu mogono Sayiru mogono ma Babila, u nekei kadanshi a maꞋasaka KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka. <verse eid="EZR 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14" />Na lo koci ba, Mogono Sayiru ɗa u bonokoi n ucanuku wa azanariya n wa azurufa u na mogono Nebukadnezaru u pura̱i a KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile a Urushelima u banai u zuwai u ɗa a̱ ma̱va̱li ma̱ a̱ma̱li a Babila. Ɗa mogono Sayiru u zuwai ucanuku wa ekiye a Sheshibazaru, vuza na a zuwai gomuna vu Yahuda. <verse eid="EZR 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15" />Ɗa Sayiru mogono ma dana ni, &lt;&lt;Pura̱ ucanuku u nampa, vu bonoko u ɗa a KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile a Urushelima, ka̱ta̱ a maꞋasaka KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka a̱ ubuta̱ u na ki ishi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EZR 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16" />Ɗa Sheshibazaru u banai u varai kumaꞋa ku KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile a Urushelima. Ili i na i ɗikai a makyan ma nanlo ali n gogo na i ta̱ lo ulinga u kumaꞋa wa, tana o kotso ba.&gt; <verse eid="EZR 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17" />Adama a nanai, a̱ ubuta̱ u na baci u gaꞋin mogono, yaꞋan a̱ la̱na̱ punu a̱ kunu ka atagarda a tsumani a Babila, ko i ta̱ e kene ubuta̱ u na mogono Sayiru u ɗanai u nekei kadanshi a maꞋasaka KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile a Urushelima ko ta nanai ba. YaꞋan mogono ma̱ suꞋuku tsu n kusheshe ku ni, a ukuna u kadanshi ka nampa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EZR 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6" />
  <para style="s1">Mogono Dariyu u nekei kadanshi a̱ gita̱ kumaꞋa ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1" />Ɗa mogono Dariyu u nekei kadanshi, a bana a̱ la̱na̱ a̱ kunu ka atagarda a tsumani a na i a Babila a̱ ubuta̱ u na a zuwai atagarda a tsumani o tsugono. <verse eid="EZR 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2" />Ama a Ekabatana likuci i gbayin i na yi uɓon u Midiya ta ɗe a ciya̱i katagarda ka̱ uka̱ta̱li ko yoku n iɗani i nampa ya, &lt;&lt;Ili i kuciɓasa. <verse eid="EZR 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka̱ ugiti ko tsugono tsu Sayiru, u nekei kadanshi adama a KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ku na ki a Urushelima. U nekei kadanshi o doku a maꞋasaka KpaꞋa ka, ubuta̱ u na a kuyaꞋansa alyuka. YaꞋan a vara kumiꞋi ku kumaꞋa ka, uɗa̱ngi u kumaꞋa wa u yawa udashi amanga̱na̱shinkupa washi u ni kpamu u yawa amanga̱na̱shinkupa. <verse eid="EZR 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4" />Na ɗa tsu na a kumaꞋa kasaka ka. I ta̱ e kukiyangu atali gbagbain a na a sheꞋwei uwalaki ku tatsu, ka̱ta̱ a kiyangu nɗanga uwalaki ku te. A̱ ubuta̱ u kazuwi ka kpaꞋa ku mogono maꞋa a kutakpa ikebe i kutsupa ulinga wa. <verse eid="EZR 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5" />Kpamu ucanuku wa azanariya n azurufa u na Nebukadnezaru u pura̱i A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a na i a Urushelima ɗa u tuka̱i a Babila. I ta̱ o kubonoko n uɗa a̱ ubuta̱ u na wi ishi A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a Urushelima. I ta̱ a ku zuwa uɗa a KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EZR 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6" />&lt;&lt;Ɗa mogono Dariyu ushuki u danai, akaka a kubana u Tatenayi gomuna vu uɓon wu upashi u kuyene ku Yufiretu n Shetaru-bozenayi n a̱ɗa̱ na yi a̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ e le, nkoshi n gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ mu uɓon kapashi ka kuyene ku Yufiretu, a̱ ɗa̱nga̱ lo. <verse eid="EZR 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7" />Takpai ekiye a̱ɗa̱ a̱ ubuta̱ wu ulinga u KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka adama a na ulinga wa u lyaꞋa kelime. Ka̱sukpa̱i gomuna vu Yahuda nu nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n le a maꞋasaka KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka a̱ ubuta̱ u na ku ɗa ki ishi. <verse eid="EZR 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8" />Nannai ɗa koci ba, n neke ta̱ kadanshi i yaꞋan tsu na i kuyaꞋan dem i ɓa̱nka̱ nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ ma aza a Yahuda adama a na a maꞋasaka KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka. A tsupa uma a nanlo ikebe yi ulinga i le uta̱ka̱ punu ikebe ya a̱ ubuta̱ u kuzuwa ku kpaꞋa ku mogono, ikebe yi utafu i na isai uɓon kapashi ke kuyene ku Yufiretu. A tsupa le mayin ka̱ta̱ a ɗika makyan ba. <verse eid="EZR 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9" />I neke anan ganu a na i a Urushelima ili i na a cigai a kanna dem ka̱ta̱ i taɗa ba. I neke le mbomburon ko a̱giri ko nkyon adama a alyuka o kusongu a̱ Ka̱shile ka gaɗi. I neke le alkama ko mkpaɗi ko ma̱kya̱n ko maniꞋin ma zaitu. <verse eid="EZR 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10" />Adama a na a yaꞋan alyuka asingai u Ka̱shile ka gaɗi, ka̱ta̱ kpamu a yaꞋan avasa adama o mogono n muku n ni. <verse eid="EZR 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11" />Kpamu n dana ta̱ vuza na baci u kpa̱ɗa̱i kutono wila̱ u nampa, i ta̱ a kutakpa maɗanga a kpaꞋa ku ni, ka̱ta̱ e sheꞋwe maꞋa, ka̱ta̱ o sovo yi n maꞋa ali ma uta̱i n tsu nan ɗe a i kyamba i ni. Kpamu i ta̱ a ku na kpaꞋa ku ni ra̱ka̱-ra̱ka̱. <verse eid="EZR 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12" />YaꞋan Ka̱shile ka na ka zuwai kula ku ni a Urushelima, u takpa mogono dem ko uma a na i a kuciga ku sabaꞋa wila̱ u nampa ko a̱ la̱nga̱sa̱ KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile a Urushelima. Mpa mogono Dariyu n zuwa ta̱ wila̱ u nampa, yaꞋan yaba dem u tono u ɗa mayin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EZR 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erengi A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13" />Ɗa Tatenayi gomuna vu uɓon kapashi ke kuyene ku Yufiretu, n Shetaru-bozenayi n a̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ e le o tonoi wila̱ u na mogono Dariyu u zuwakai le mayin. <verse eid="EZR 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14" />Ta nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n Yahuda a lyaꞋi kelime n kumaꞋa n ciya̱i utsura u ka̱ɗu adama e kene ku na Hagai n Zakariya maku Ido a yaꞋin. O kotsoi kumaꞋa ka tsu na Ka̱shile ki Isaraila ka danai Sayiru n Dariyu n Atazesu kpamu, ngono m Pashiya. <verse eid="EZR 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15" />O kotsoi kumaꞋa ka̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin ka a kanna ka tatsu ko wotoi u tatsu, a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka̱ ta̱li ko tsugono tsu Dariyu mogono.<verse eid="EZR 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16" />Ɗa aza a Isaraila, n anan ganu n aza e Levi n kagimi ka uma a na o bonoi n ugbashi a yaꞋin ka̱ɗiva̱ ke kerengu ku KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile n ma̱za̱nga̱. <verse eid="EZR 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17" />A̱ ka̱ɗiva̱ ke kerengu ku KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka, uma a yaꞋin alyuka n obomburon amangatawun (100), n a̱giri amangatawenre (200), n muku mu nkyon amangatawuna̱na̱shi (400). Ɗa kpamu e nekei nga̱ji kupa n re adama e kuneꞋe ku kutakpa unushi a̱ ka̱ɗu ka yaba dem a Isaraila. <verse eid="EZR 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18" />Ɗa e peciki anan ganu n aza e Levi ka̱tsura̱-ka̱tsura̱ adama a ulinga u Ka̱shile a Urushelima, tsu na wi a uɗani a katagarda ka Musa.<verse eid="EZR 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ka̱ɗiva̱ ka Kupasamgbanai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19" />A kanna ka kupa n ka̱ na̱shi ko wotoi u iyain, ɗa uma o bonoi n ugbashi a yaꞋin Ka̱ɗiva̱ ka Kupasamgbanai. <verse eid="EZR 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20" />Adama a na anan ganu n aza e Levi ra̱ka̱ a takpaka ta̱ ɗe ka̱ci ke le nshinda̱, ra̱ka̱ vi le okpoi ciɗa. Ɗa aza e Levi a kiɗai ma̱giri ma̱ Ka̱ɗiva̱ ka Kupasamgbanai adama a aza a na o bonoi n ugbashi, n adama aza e le anan ganu n adama a̱ ka̱ci ke le kpamu. <verse eid="EZR 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21" />Uma a Isaraila a na o bonoi n ugbashi, koɓolo n aza a na e pecei ka̱ci ke le n ukuna wu unata wu uduniyan u na wi ida̱shi a iɗika ya, adama a na o tono Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki Isaraila a takumai ma̱giri ma̱ Ka̱ɗiva̱ ka Kupasamgbanai ka. <verse eid="EZR 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22" />Ɗa kpamu a yaꞋin ka̱ɗiva̱ ko Boroji vu na vi n yisiti ba ali ayin e cindere ele a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱, adama a na Vuzavaguɗu u zuwa le ta̱ a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ a na u vadalukpai ka̱ɗu ko mogono ma Asiriya we e le, adama a na u ɓa̱nka̱ le ta̱ ulinga u kumaꞋa KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile, Ka̱shile ki Isaraila.<verse eid="EZR 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ezira u yawai a Urushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1" />Ana ka nanlo ko kotsoi, a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka ayin tsugono tsu Atazesu mogono ma Pashiya, ɗa Ezira u yevei kumaci ku ni, a na a̱yi maku ma Seraya maꞋa a kpaꞋa ku Azariya maku ma Hilikiya, <verse eid="EZR 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2" />Hilikiya maku ma Shalum, Shalum maku ma Zadoku, Zadoku maku ma Ahitubu, <verse eid="EZR 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3" />Ahitubu maku ma Amariya, Amariya maku ma Azariya, Azariya maku ma Marayotu, <verse eid="EZR 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4" />Marayotu maku ma Zerahiya, Zerahiya maku ma Uzi, Uzi maku ma Buki, <verse eid="EZR 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5" />Buki maku ma Abishuwa, Abishuwa maku ma Finihasu, Finihasu maku ma Eliyaza, n Haruna ganu vu gbayin. <verse eid="EZR 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6" />Ezira vu nampa va a̱yi ɗa wu uta̱i a Babila. A̱yi kaɗani kaꞋa, u yeve ta̱ wila̱ u Musa u na Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki Isaraila ke nekei keniki Musa. Ɗa mogono tana me nekei ni i na u folonoi ra̱ka̱, adama a na Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ koɓolo n a̱yi. <verse eid="EZR 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ke cindere ko tsugono tsu mogono Atazesu, ɗa Ezira wu uta̱i a iɗika i Babila a kubana a Urushelima koɓolo ka̱tsura̱ ka aza a Isaraila, n anan ganu o yoku n aza e Levi n aza a ishipa n aza a kindi n aza a ulinga a KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile. <verse eid="EZR 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8" />Ezira u yawai a Urushelima o wotoi u tawun a̱ ka̱ya̱ ke cindere ko tsugono tsu mogono Atazesu. <verse eid="EZR 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9" />A kanna ka iyain ko wotoi u iyain u ka̱sukpa̱i Babila, ɗa u yawai a Urushelima a kanna ka iyain ko u tawun, adama a na kukiye ku singai ku Ka̱shile ki ta̱ n a̱yi. <verse eid="EZR 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10" />Adama a na Ezira u neke ta̱ ka̱ci ka̱ ni u yeve wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu n kutono u ɗa, kpamu n u piꞋisakai aza a Isaraila ili i kutono n kadanshi.<verse eid="EZR 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mogono Atazesu u nekei Ezira katagarda ka akaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11" />Na ɗa katagarda ka wila̱ ka na mogono Atazesu u nekei Ezira ganu kaɗani kpamu. Wi ta̱ n kuyeve mayin a ukuna u wila̱ n kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu wa aza a Isaraila. U danai, <verse eid="EZR 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12" />&lt;&lt;Atazesu mogono mo ngono, ikya̱shi a kubana u Ezira ganu kaɗani ka̱ wila̱ u Ka̱shile ka gaɗi, <verse eid="EZR 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13" />Gogo na n neke ta̱ kadanshi a na vuma vi Isaraila dem ko anan ganu n aza e Levi a na i punu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko tsugono tsu va̱, vuza baci u cigai kubana a Urushelima. U bana a koɓolo n avu. <verse eid="EZR 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14" />Adama a na mogono ma a n uma e cindere aza a odoki a̱ ni a ɗa a̱ suki nu, vu bana vu la̱na̱ tsu na uma a Yahuda n aza a Urushelima i a ida̱shi tsu na kuyotsongusu ku wila̱ u Ka̱shile ka̱ nu, ku na wi ekiye a̱ nu. <verse eid="EZR 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15" />Ka̱ta̱ kpamu vu ɗika azurufa n azanariya a na mogono n aza a odoki a̱ ni e nekei Ka̱shile ki Isaraila n ucigi wa̱ a̱ɗu e le, vuza na ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi i ni yi a Urushelima, <verse eid="EZR 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16" />n azurufa n azanariya ra̱ka̱ a na va kuɓolongu a uɓon u Babila, koɓolo n kuneꞋe ku ucigi wa̱ a̱ɗu a na uma a Isaraila n anan ganu e nekei adama a KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ke le a Urushelima. <verse eid="EZR 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17" />N ikebe i nampa i ɗa va kutsula obomburon n a̱giri nu ngiri, koɓolo n kuneꞋe ki ishina ku le n ki ili i kusoꞋo, ka̱ta̱ vu lyuka le a gaɗi vu katalikalyuka ka KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka̱ nu a Urushelima. <verse eid="EZR 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18" />Ka̱ta̱, kagimi ka azurufa n azanariya a na a buwai, avu n aza a̱ nu i yaꞋan i na yi enei i gaꞋin ɗa̱, tsu na Ka̱shile ka̱ ɗa̱ ka cigai. <verse eid="EZR 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19" />Ucanuku u na e nekei nu adama a ulinga u KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile, vu banka u ɗa a̱ ubuta̱ Ka̱shile a Urushelima. <verse eid="EZR 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20" />Ili i na baci i a kuciga dem adama a ulinga KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka̱ nu, n ili i na avu feu i yotsoi vi neke. Vu takpa ikebe ya a̱ ubuta̱ u kuzuwa ku mogono.<verse eid="EZR 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21" />&lt;&lt;Mpa mogono Atazesu, n neke ta̱ kadanshi a̱ ubuta̱ wa azuwi a ikebe yi uɓon kapashi ke kuyene ku Yufiretu, n danai e neke Ezira ganu, kaɗani ka̱ wila̱ u Ka̱shile ka gaɗi, ili ra̱ka̱ i na u cigai wa̱ ɗa̱, i neke yi i ɗa n ka̱ɗu ke te. <verse eid="EZR 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22" />Ka̱ta̱ i neke yi azurufa a na a yawai kilo a̱kpa̱n a tatsu n amangatawa̱na̱shi (3,400) n aburuma a alkama amangatawun (100), n edele a̱ ma̱kya̱n a̱kpa̱n e re (2,000), n edele a maniꞋin ma zaitu a̱kpa̱n e re (2,000), n ka̱bunda̱i ka mkpaɗi n na a kuciga dem. <verse eid="EZR 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23" />Ili ra̱ka̱ i na Ka̱shile ka gaɗi ka danai adama a KpaꞋa ku ni, ka̱ta̱ a yaꞋan i ɗa n ka̱ɗu ke te, adama a na ka̱ta̱ Ka̱shile ka yaꞋan wupa n tsugono tsu mogono koɓolo n muku n ni ba. <verse eid="EZR 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24" />Ci ta̱ kpamu a kudana ɗa̱, ka̱ta̱ yi isa ikebe yi utafu, ko ikebe i kuꞋuwa n i kuta̱ka̱ n ucanuku n ikebe yi uye, ekiye a anan ganu n aza e Levi n aza a ishipa n aza a kindi koɓolo n aza a ulinga a kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ku nampa ba.<verse eid="EZR 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25" />&lt;&lt;Avu Ezra tamkpamu, vu yaꞋan ulinga n kuyeve ku na Ka̱shile ke nekei nu, vu zagba azafada n ayaꞋinfada adama a na o tono n aza a na i a upashi u kuyene ku Yufiretu, aza a na e yevei wila̱ u Ka̱shile ka̱ nu. Ka̱ta̱ kpamu vu piꞋisaka aza a na e yevei u ɗa ba. <verse eid="EZR 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26" />Vuza na baci u iwain kutono wila̱ u Ka̱shile ka̱ nu n u mogono, mayun ɗa a kiɗaka yi afada, a̱ ukpa̱ ko kuloko n a na a ki isa uciyi u ni ko kpamu a gbagura yi a̱ kunu ku ugbashi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EZR 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ezira u cikpai Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27" />Ɗa Ezira u danai, ucikpi u Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki ikaya i tsu, a̱yi vuza na u zuwai kusheshe ku nampa a̱ ka̱ɗu ko mogono adama a na u neke KpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu ku na ki a Urushelima tsugbayin a̱ ubuta̱ u kumaꞋasaka ku ɗa. <verse eid="EZR 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28" />N kasingai ka̱ ni kaꞋa n ciya̱i mapasa ma singai u mogono n aza a odoki a̱ ni nu nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱. Ɗa n ciya̱i utsura u ka̱ɗu adama a na kukiye ku Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱ ki ta̱ koɓolo n mpa, ali ɗa n fuɗai n ɓolongi aza e kelime ka Isaraila o bono koɓolo n mpa.<verse eid="EZR 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8" />
  <para style="s1">Uma a na o bonoi n ugbashi koɓolo n Ezira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1" />Na ɗa ula aza e kelime ka iꞋuwa yi ikaya i le, n ka̱bunda̱i ka aza a na o bonoi n ugbashi a iɗika i Babila koɓolo n Ezira a kubana a Urushelima, a ayin o tsugono tsu mogono Atazesu. <verse eid="EZR 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2" />A ntsukaya n Finihasu, Geshon ɗa vuza vu kelime. A ntsukaya n Itama, Daniyelu ɗa vuza vu kelime. <verse eid="EZR 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3" />A ntsukaya n Dawuda, Hatushi maku ma Shekaniya ɗa vuza vu kelime. A ntsukaya n Paroshi, Zakariya ɗa vuza vu kelime. Ɗa u bonoi n ali amangatawun n amangerenkupa (150) a ntsukaya n ni. A̱ ciya̱ ta̱ ula e le a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka tsumani ci ikaya i le. <verse eid="EZR 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4" />A ntsukaya n Pahatu-mowabu, Eliyahona maku ma Zerahiya ɗa vuza vu kelime. U bonoi n ali amangatawenre (200). <verse eid="EZR 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5" />A ntsukaya n Zatu, Shekaniya maku ma Jahaziyelu ɗa vuza vu kelime. U bonoi n ali amangatawantatsu (300). <verse eid="EZR 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6" />A ntsukaya n Adini, Ebedu maku ma Janata ɗa vuza vu kelime. Ɗa u bonoi n ali amangerenkupa. <verse eid="EZR 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7" />A ntsukaya n Elam, Jeshaya maku ma Ataliya ɗa vuza vu kelime. Ɗa u bonoi n ali amangatatsunkupa. <verse eid="EZR 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8" />A ntsukaya n Shefatiya, Zebadiya maku ma Mikayelu ɗa vuza vu kelime. Ɗa u bonoi n ali amanga̱na̱shi. <verse eid="EZR 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9" />A ntsukaya n Jowabu, Obodiya maku ma Jehiyelu ɗa vuza vu kelime. Ɗa u bonoi n ali amangatawenre n kupa n kula̱i (218). <verse eid="EZR 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10" />A ntsukaya m Bani, Shelomitu maku ma Josifiya ɗa vuza vu kelime. Ɗa u bonoi n ali amangatawun n amangatatsu (160). <verse eid="EZR 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11" />A ntsukaya m Bebayi, Zakariya maku ma Bebayi ɗa vuza vu kelime. U bonoi n ali kamanga n kula̱i. <verse eid="EZR 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12" />A ntsukaya n Azagada, Johanan maku ma Hakatan ɗa vuza vu kelime. Ɗa u bonoi n ali amangatawun n kupa (110). <verse eid="EZR 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13" />A ntsukaya n Adonikam, aza a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i n ka̱ca̱pa̱, Elifeletu n Jeyiyelu n Shemaya ele ɗa aza e kelime. Ɗa o bonoi n ali amangatatsu. <verse eid="EZR 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14" />A ntsukaya n Bigawai, Utayi n Zabuda ele ɗa aza e kelime. Ɗa o bonoi n ali amangatatsunkupa.<verse eid="EZR 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nwalu n Ezira a kubana a Urushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15" />Ɗa n ɓolongi uma a nampa a̱ ka̱kina̱ ke kuyene ku tsu yene a kubana a̱ likuci i Ahava, ta lo tsu da̱sa̱ngi ayin a tatsu. Ɗa n la̱na̱i uma n anan ganu, ama n ciya̱ aza Levi punu ba. <verse eid="EZR 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16" />Ɗa n zuwai e ɗekei mu Eliyaza n Ariyelu n Shemaya n Elinatan n Jaribu n Elinatan n Natan n Zakariya n Meshulam, e le na i aza e kelime. Ɗa kpamu n zuwai e ɗekekei mu Joyaribu n Elinatan adama a na ele va eyevi a ɗa. <verse eid="EZR 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17" />Ɗa n suki le a bana u Ido vuza vu kelime vu Kasifiya, n danai le ili i na a kudana Ido n aza a̱ ni a na i a kuyaꞋan ulinga a KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile. Aza a na i a ida̱shi a Kasifiya, adama a na a̱ suꞋuku tsu n aza a ulinga a KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu a Urushelima. <verse eid="EZR 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18" />A na wokpoi kukiye ku singai ku Ka̱shile ki ta̱ koɓolo n a̱tsu. Ɗa a̱ suꞋuki tsu n Sherebiya keyevi, a kumaci ku Mali maku ma Levi maku mi Isaraila. Ɗa u ta̱wa̱i n muku mo olobo n ni n aza a̱ ni. Ele ɗa uma kupa n kula̱i. <verse eid="EZR 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19" />Ɗa kpamu a̱ suꞋuki tsu n Hashabiya koɓolo n Jeshaya a kumaci ku Merari, n aza a̱ ni n muku n le. Ele ɗa uma kamanga. <verse eid="EZR 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20" />Na lo ɗa koci ba, a̱ suꞋuki tsu kpamu n uma amangatawenre n kamanga (220), aza a ulinga a KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile a na Dawuda mogono nu nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ a zagbai adama a na a̱ ɓa̱nka̱ aza e Levi. Ɗa e kecei ka̱bunda̱i ka le ra̱ka̱ n ula e le. <verse eid="EZR 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21" />Lo e kuyene ku Ahava ka, ɗa n salai a yaꞋan kakuli, adama a na tsu goyo ka̱ci ka̱ tsu a̱ ubuta̱ u Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu, kpamu tsu folono yi u tono n a̱tsu a uye wu nwalu n tsu, n muku n tsu n ucanuku u tsu. <verse eid="EZR 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22" />Adama a na m pana ta̱ wono a na mo folono mogono me neke tsu osoji a iɗika n akumbi odoku, adama a na isa tsu a̱ ubuta̱ wi irala i tsu a uye. Adama a na n dana ta̱ ɗe mogono, kukiye ku singai ku Ka̱shile ki ta̱ koɓolo n yaba dem vu na u nekei ka̱ɗu wa̱ a̱ ni, Ama wupa u ni wi ta̱ u vuza na u vadalukpa ka ni kucina̱. <verse eid="EZR 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23" />Adama a nanai ɗa ci yaꞋin kakuli, tsu folonoi Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu ko tono n a̱tsu, ɗa tana ushuki avasa a̱ tsu.<verse eid="EZR 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E pecekushi ucanuku u KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24" />Ɗa n takpai uma kupa n e re a̱ aza e kelime a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka anan ganu, ele ɗa Sherebiya n Hashabiya n aza a̱ e le uma kupa. <verse eid="EZR 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25" />Ɗa n gisanki le azurufa n azanariya n ucanuku, kuneꞋen adama a KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu, ku na mogono n aza odoki a̱ ni nu nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n ni n aza Isaraila ra̱ka̱ a na i lo a̱ ubuta̱ wa e nekei. <verse eid="EZR 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26" />Na ɗa ili i na n gisangi ɗa n nekei anan ganu ekiye. Kagisamkpatsu ka azurufa ka na a̱miki a̱ ni a yawai kamanga n e re. Ucanuku u na a yaꞋin n azurufa amangatawun (100), u na a̱miki e le a yawai kilo amangatatsunkupa. N Azanariya a na a̱miki e le a yawai a̱kpa̱n a tatsu n amangatawa̱na̱shi (3,400). <verse eid="EZR 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27" />N ebelyu azanariya kamanga (20), a na a̱miki e le a yawai kilo ka̱kpa̱n (1,000).<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A̱miki a ikebe ya yi ta̱ a̱ kuka̱na̱ viyum vi te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ki i na̱shi 1/4 ko iyim kunla̱i n kagimi (8.5). </char></note> N ebelyu e re a iyim i shili a na a lapulai, tsuloboi ci le derere ɗa n azanariya. <verse eid="EZR 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28" />Ɗa n danai le,&lt;&lt;A̱ɗa̱ n ucanuku u nampa me erengu ɗa̱ ta̱ ciɗa u Vuzavaguɗu. Azurufa n azanariya tankpamu n kuneꞋen ku ucigi wa̱ a̱ɗu u Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki ikaya i le. <verse eid="EZR 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29" />Yi inda u ɗa, ka̱ta̱ kpamu i la̱na̱ u ɗa ali a ayin a na i gisangu u ɗa anunu a KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile e kelime ka anan ganu n aza e Levi n aza e kelime ka aza a Isaraila a Urushelima.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EZR 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30" />Ɗa anan ganu n aza e Levi isai azurufa n azanariya n ucanuku u na a gisangi a̱miki e le, adama a na a banka n u ɗa a KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu a Urushelima.<verse eid="EZR 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31" />Ɗa tsu ɗa̱nga̱i a̱ ka̱kina̱ ke kuyene ku Ahava a kanna ka kupa n ke ire ko wotoi u iyain, adama a na tsu bana a Urushelima. Kukiye ku Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu ki ta̱ koɓolo n a̱tsu, ɗa kpamu wi isai tsu ekiye a irala i tsu n aza a̱ ma̱ga̱la̱ka̱ a uye. <verse eid="EZR 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32" />Ta ci yawai a Urushelima nannai, ɗa tsu uvukai lo ayin a tatsu. <verse eid="EZR 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33" />A kanna ka̱ na̱shi, ɗa tsu banai a KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu, taɗe tsu gisangi azurufa n azanariya n ucanuku, ɗa tsu nekei ganu Meremotu kolobo ka Uriya. Koɓolo n Eliyaza kolobo ka Finihasu n aza e Levi o yoku, ele ɗa Jozabadu kolobo ka Jesuwa n Nowadiya kolobo ka Binuyi. <verse eid="EZR 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34" />Ɗa e kecei ili ra̱ka̱ ɗa kpamu a gisangi i ɗa, ɗa a ɗanai ka̱bunda̱i ka̱ a̱miki a na a gisangi va. <verse eid="EZR 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35" />Ɗa aza a na o bonoi n ugbashi, e nekei alyuka o kusongu u Ka̱shile ki Isaraila. A lyukai obomburom kupa n e re adama aza a Isaraila dem, n a̱giri amanga̱na̱shinkupa n a̱ta̱li, nu ngiri amangatatsunkupa n cindere. Ɗa kpamu a yaꞋain alyuka a kutakpa unushi nu nga̱ji kupa n re. Ɗa e nekei alyuka kusongu a nampa ra̱ka̱ u Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="EZR 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36" />Ɗa e nekei katagarda ka̱ wila̱ u mogono Atazesu wa aza o tsugono n i gomuna yi uɓon upashi kuyene ku Yufiretu. Ɗa ele feu a̱ ɓa̱nka̱i uma n KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile.<verse eid="EZR 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9" />
  <para style="s1">Kavasa ka Ezira adama o yolo n kumaci ku yoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1" />Ana ka nampa ko kotsoi, ɗa nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ ma aza a Isaraila a̱ ta̱wa̱i a danai mu, &lt;&lt;Uma a Isaraila n anan ganu n aza e Levi a takpa ka̱ci ke le kau n ukuna wu unata u uma a iɗika ya ba, aza KanaꞋana n aza a Hitiya n aza a Periziya n aza Jebusiya n aza Amona n aza a Mowabu n aza a Masar n aza a Amoriya ba. <verse eid="EZR 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2" />Adama a na ali a Isaraila a ɗikaka ta̱ ka̱ci ke le a̱ma̱ci a uma a iɗika ya, ali a ɗikaka feu muku le a̱ma̱ci a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ke le. Ta a satarai kumaci ku ciɗa n uma a iɗika ya. Kpamu aza e kelime n nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ i ta̱ n kukiye punu a ukuna wi ili i wono i nampa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EZR 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3" />Ana m panai ukuna u nanlo ɗa n karai ntogu n va̱ n muɗa̱i ka̱nji ka kaci ka̱ va̱ n ntsa̱ka̱ n va̱, ɗa n da̱sa̱ngi n nambai ili i na ma kudansa. <verse eid="EZR 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4" />Ɗa yaba dem vu na u jeꞋekei ikyamba adama a kadanshi ka̱ Ka̱shile ki Isaraila, n adama a ukuna wu unambi wu usuɓi wa aza a na o bonoi n ugbashi, o ɓolongi a̱ uka̱ra̱Ꞌi nu mpa a makyan ma na n yongoi una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱, ali a makyan ma alyuka a̱ kulivi ma yawai. <verse eid="EZR 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5" />Ana makyan ma alyuka ma̱ kulivi ma yawai, ɗa n ɗa̱nga̱i a̱ una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱ u va̱ u uki n akari a ntogu n va̱. Ɗa n kuɗa̱ngi a iɗika, ɗa n ɗa̱ngusa̱i ekiye a̱ va̱ u Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, <verse eid="EZR 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6" />ɗa n vasai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 9:6">&lt;&lt;Ka̱shile ka̱va̱, wono u kimba̱ mu ta̱ ali n fuɗa n ɗa̱ngusa̱ kaci ka̱ va̱ wa̱ a̱nu ba. Adama a na unushi u tsu u laꞋa ta̱ utsura u tsu, ali u yawai gaɗi. <verse eid="EZR 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7" />Ili i na i ɗikai a ayin a ikaya i tsu ali a̱ kuta̱wa̱ anana, ci yaꞋan ta̱ unushi u gbayin. Adama unushi u tsu, a̱tsu nu ngono n tsu n anan ganu a̱ tsu, ɗa tsu yikpa̱i ekiye ngono ma aza a̱ ka̱yimbi. Ɗa a unai tsu, ɗa a̱ pura̱i tsu a kubana ugbashi n ucanuku u tsu, ɗa a zuwai tsu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko wono tsu na ci anana. <verse eid="EZR 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8" />Ama makyan kenu, Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱tsu u yotsongu tsu ta̱ kasingai ana u ka̱sukpa̱i kagimi ka uma a̱tsu n wuma, ana kpamu u nekei tsu ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi u ciɗa, adama a na u jebeke tsu atakaci a tsugbashi, ka̱ta̱ kpamu u zuwa a̱shi a̱ tsu akana. <verse eid="EZR 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9" />Ko ana wo okpoi a̱tsu agbashi a ɗa. Ka̱shile ka̱tsu ka cinukpa n a̱tsu a̱ ubuta̱ u tsugbashi u tsu ba. Ama ɗa u zuwai ngono ma aza Pashiya a yaꞋankai tsu ukuna u ma̱riki ali ɗa e nekei ili na tsu cigai adama a na tsu maꞋasaka KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile, ka̱ta̱ kpamu tsu lapula ubuta̱ u na wi ishi u yikpa̱i adama a na tsu ci ya̱ mashilya mana ma ku keɗe tsu aza a Yahuda n Urushelima. <verse eid="EZR 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10" />Ama gogo na, Ka̱shile ka̱va̱, yiɗa̱i tsa ku dansa a ukuna u nampa? Adama a na tsu iwan ta̱ kutono wila̱ u nu. <verse eid="EZR 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11" />U na vu nekei tsu a̱ ubuta̱ u eneki aza a na i a kuyaꞋanka wu ulinga, a na vu danai tsu, &lt;Iɗika i na ci a kuꞋuwa ci lyaꞋa uka̱ni wi i ɗa, iɗika ya yi ta̱ nu nshinda̱. Uma a iɗika ya i ta̱ tukpa n kagbanigbani. <verse eid="EZR 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12" />Adama a nannai ka̱ta̱ tsu ka̱sukpa̱ nkere n tsu mo olo le ba, ko kpamu olobo a̱ tsu a zuwa nkere n le ba, ka̱ta̱ kpamu tsu ɓa̱nka̱ le, ko tsu la̱nsa̱ ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ n i le ba. Ta tsa ku tsurakpa nannai ka̱ta̱ kpamu tsu pana uyoꞋo wi iɗika ya, ka̱ta̱ a̱tsu tsu ka̱sukpa̱ka̱ muku iɗika ya yo okpo ili yi uka̱ni i le ko wannai.&gt; <verse eid="EZR 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13" />Ana ili i nampa i ciya̱i tsu ra̱ka̱ adama ulinga u gbani-gbani u tsu nu unushi wa̱ bunda̱i tsu, ci yeve ta̱ n nannai dem avu Ka̱shile ka̱tsu vu neke tsu atakaci a̱bunda̱i adama u nushi u tsu ba, ali vu ka̱sukpa̱ka̱i tsu kagimi ka uma tsu nampa ba. <verse eid="EZR 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14" />Nini ɗai tsu ku doku ku koɗo wila̱ u nu a̱ ubuta̱ u ku nekpenei yolo n uma a na i a kuyaꞋan ili yi unata i nampa? Ci yaꞋan baci nannai, vi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan wupa n a̱tsu ali vu una tsu ra̱ka̱-ra̱ka̱, babu aza a na a kubuwa kpamu babu aza a na a kulaꞋa. <verse eid="EZR 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15" />Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki Isaraila, avu vuza vu usuɓi ɗa, a̱tsu tsu laꞋaka tsu kagimi ka uma a na a buwai, tsu na ci anana. A̱tsu ɗa na e kelime ka̱ nu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ unushi u tsu, ko ana wokpoi adama a ili i nampa babu vuza vu na wa kufuɗa kushamgba e kelime ka̱ nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EZR 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10" />
  <para style="s1">Uma a̱ shika̱i unushi u le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1" />Ana Ezira wi a kuyaꞋan avasa, a̱ kushika̱ unushi nu shika̱i, a u kuɗa̱ngi e kelime ka̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ Ka̱shile, ɗa ka̱bunda̱i ka uma ali n a̱ma̱ci n muku a Isaraila o ɓolongi wa̱ a̱ ni. Ɗa uma a̱ shika̱i gbani-gbani. <verse eid="EZR 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2" />Ɗa Shekaniya maku ma Jehiyelu matsukaya ma Elam u danai Ezira, &lt;&lt;Ci yaꞋanka ta̱ Ka̱shile ka̱tsu unambi wu usuɓi a̱ ubuta̱ u kuzuwa omoci a̱ma̱ci a uma a iɗika ya. Ama n nannai dem a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱ a buwa ta̱ wa aza a Isaraila. <verse eid="EZR 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3" />Adama a nannai yaꞋan ci yaꞋan uzuwakpani n Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu, tsu loko a̱ma̱ci a nanlo a n muku n le tsu na avu n aza e kelime a na yi o kutono kadanshi ka̱ Ka̱shile i nekei tsu odoki. Ci ta̱ o kutono ili i na kadanshi ka̱ Ka̱shile ka danai. <verse eid="EZR 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4" />Ɗa̱nga̱ adama a na kakuna ka nampa ki ta̱ ekiye a̱ nu. A̱tsu ci ta̱ a̱ kucina̱ ku nu. Adama a nannai yaꞋan utsura u ka̱ɗu, ka̱ta̱ vu yaꞋan ili i na i yotsoi vi yaꞋan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EZR 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5" />Ɗa Ezira u ɗa̱nga̱i u zuwai aza e kelime a anan ganu n aza e Levi n uma a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ a kucinai a danai, ci ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ili i na Shekaniya u danai. A ɗikai akucina.<verse eid="EZR 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6" />Ɗa Ezira u ɗa̱nga̱i a̱ ubuta̱ u na wi ɗevu n KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile, u lazai a kubana a̱ kunu ku Jehohanan maku ma Eliyashibu. Punu a̱ kunu ka u lyaꞋa ba u soꞋo ba, adama a na wi ta̱ a̱ una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱ adama a unambi wu usuɓi wa aza a na o bonoi n ugbashi. <verse eid="EZR 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7" />Ɗa a salai a̱ ubuta̱ dem a Urushelima n uɓon u Yahuda a dana aza na obonoi n ugbashi ra̱ka̱ o ɓolongu a Urushelima, <verse eid="EZR 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8" />vuza na baci u kpa̱ɗa̱i kubana ali ayin a tatsu, tsu na aza e kelime nu nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ e nekei kadanshi, wi ta̱ a kunamba ucanuku u ni, kpamu i ta̱ a̱ ku uta̱ka̱ yi a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko koɓolo ka uma a na obonoi n ugbashi. <verse eid="EZR 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9" />Kafu ayin a tatsu a ɗa ali a na i a̱ ida̱shi a uɓon u Yahuda nu n Bayami ra̱ka̱ o ɓolongi a Urushelima. A kanna ka kamanga o wotoi u kuci ɗa uma ra̱ka̱ a̱ disa̱ngushi e kelime ka ulanga u na wi e kelime ka KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile. Ɗa yaba dem u jeꞋekei ikyamba adama ukuna u nanlo, kpamu n mini ma̱ a̱bunda̱i ma na Ka̱shile ko yoꞋi. <verse eid="EZR 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10" />Ɗa Ezira ganu u ɗa̱nga̱i kashani u yaꞋankai le kadanshi u danai, &lt;&lt;I yaꞋan ta̱ ukuna wu unambi wu usuɓi a̱ ubuta̱ u kuzuwa omoci a̱ma̱ci aza a na i aza a Yahuda ba. Tsu nanlo tsu ɗa i doki unushi wa aza Isaraila. <verse eid="EZR 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11" />Gogo i dana Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki ikaya i ɗa̱ unushi u ɗa̱. Ka̱ta̱ kpamu i yaꞋin ili na u cigai. I pece ka̱ci ka̱ ɗa̱ a kumaci ki iɗika ya n omoci a̱ma̱ci a na i zuwai aza a na i aza a Yahuda ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EZR 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12" />Ɗa ka̱bunda̱i ka uma ra̱ka̱ ushuki n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka gbayin a danai, &lt;&lt;Ta nanai. Mayun ɗa ci yaꞋan tsu na vu danai. <verse eid="EZR 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13" />Ama uma a tana i ta̱ n a̱bunda̱i, kpamu ayin a̱ mini a ɗa n a̱bunda̱i. Adama a nannai ci a kufuɗa ku shamgba e keteshe ba. Ulinga wa tana ulinga u kana kete u ɗa ko u ayin e re ba, adama a na aza o yoku n a̱bunda̱i a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ tsu ci yaꞋan ta̱ unushi wu uyevi a kakuna ka nampa. <verse eid="EZR 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14" />YaꞋan aza e kelime a̱ tsu a bana a Urushelima a̱ la̱na̱ kakuna ka adama o koɓolo ka uma dem. Ka̱ta̱ uma a̱ likuci-likuci aza na a zuwai omoci a̱ma̱ci, a̱ ta̱wa̱ a makyan ma na a zuwakai le derere, koɓolo nu nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n ayaꞋinfada a̱ likuci dem. Ci ta̱ a kuyaꞋan nannai adama a na Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu ka̱ ka̱sukpa̱ wupa adama a kakuna ka nampa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EZR 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15" />Babu vuza na u yaꞋin tsurala n ukuna u nampa wa, Janata ɗa koci maku ma Asahelu n Jahazeya maku ma Tikuwa n Meshulam n Shabetayi vuma vu kumaci ku Levi a̱ ɓa̱nka̱i le. <verse eid="EZR 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16" />Ɗa aza a na o bonoi n ugbashi a yaꞋin ili i na a danai. Ɗa Ezra ganu u zagbai ali, aza a na ele ɗa aza e kelime ka kumaci ku le, tsu na i n ula e le. A gasai a kanna ka ugiti o wotoi u kupa adama a na a̱ la̱na̱ ukuna wa. <verse eid="EZR 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17" />A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko wotoi u tatsu, kafu a kanna ka iyain ko wotoi u iyain, ɗa o kotsoi kula̱na̱ ukuna u ali a na a zuwai omoci a̱ma̱ci a.<verse eid="EZR 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ali a na a zuwai omoci a̱ma̱ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18" />Na ɗa ula a anan ganu a na i a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a na a zuwai omoci a̱ma̱ci. A ntsukaya n Jesuwa maku ma Jozadaku n aza a̱ ni, MaꞋaseya wi ta̱ punu n Eliyaza n Jaribu n Gedaliya. <verse eid="EZR 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19" />A yaꞋin akucina i ta̱ o kuloko a̱ma̱ci e le, yaba dem vu le u nekei ka̱giri adama e kuneꞋe ku kutakpa unushi u le. <verse eid="EZR 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20" />A ntsukaya n Imeru n Hanani n Zebadiya. <verse eid="EZR 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21" />A ntsukaya n Harim MaꞋaseya n Iliya, koɓolo n Shemaya n Jehiyelu n Uziya. <verse eid="EZR 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22" />A ntsukaya n Pashuru, Eliyoni wi ta̱ punu n MaꞋaseya n IsumaꞋilu n Netanelu n Jozabadu n Eliyasa. <verse eid="EZR 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23" />A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza e Levi, ele ɗa, Jozabadu n Shimeyi n Kelaya vu na kpamu e ci ɗeke yi Kelita n Petahiya n Yahuda n Eliyaza. <verse eid="EZR 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24" />A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a ishipa, Eliyashibu wi ta̱ punu. Aza a kindi ku utsutsu wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin Shalum wi ta̱ punu, n Telem n Uri. <verse eid="EZR 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25" />Ula aza a Isaraila a na a yaꞋin unushi wa ele ɗa, Paroshi, n Ramiya n Iziya n Malikiya n Mijamin n Eliyaza n Malikiya, n Benaya. <verse eid="EZR 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26" />A ntsukaya n Elam, ele ɗa Mataniya n Zakariya n Jehiyelu, n Abudi n Jeremotu n Iliya. <verse eid="EZR 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27" />A ntsukaya n Zatu, ele ɗa Eliyoni n Eliyashibu n Mataniya n Jeremotu n Zabadu n Aziza. <verse eid="EZR 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28" />A ntsukaya m Bebai, ele ɗa Jehohanan n Hananiya n Zabayi n Atala. <verse eid="EZR 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29" />A ntsukaya m Bani, ele ɗa Meshulam n Maluka n Adaya n Jashubu n Sheyala n Jeremotu. <verse eid="EZR 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30" />A ntsukaya n Pahatu-mowabu, ele ɗa, Adana n Kela n Benaya n MaꞋaseya n Mataniya m Bezale m Binuyi n Manasa. <verse eid="EZR 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31" />A ntsukaya n Harim, ele ɗa, Eliyaza n Ishiya n Malikiya, n Shemaya n Simiyon, <verse eid="EZR 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32" />n Bayami n Maluka n Shemariya. <verse eid="EZR 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33" />A ntsukaya n Hashum, ele ɗa, Matenayi n Matata n Zabadu n Elifeletu n Jeremayi n Manasa n Shimeyi. <verse eid="EZR 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34" />A ntsukaya m Bani, ele ɗa, MaꞋadayi n Amuram n Uwelu, <verse eid="EZR 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35" />m Benaya m Bediya n Kela, <verse eid="EZR 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36" />m Beniya n Meremotu n Eliyashibu, <verse eid="EZR 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37" />n Mataniya n Matata n JaꞋasu. <verse eid="EZR 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38" />A ntsukaya m Binuyi, ele ɗa, Bani n Shimeyi, <verse eid="EZR 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39" />n Shelemiya n Natan n Adaya, <verse eid="EZR 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40" />n Makanadeba n Shashayi n Sharayi, <verse eid="EZR 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41" />n Azarelu n Shelemiya n Shemariya, <verse eid="EZR 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42" />n Shalum n Amariya n Isufu. <verse eid="EZR 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43" />A ntsukaya n Nebo, ele ɗa, Jeyiyelu n Matitiya n Zabadu n Zebina n Jadayi n Juwelu n Benaya. <verse eid="EZR 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44" />Uma a nampa a ra̱ka̱ a zuwa ta̱ omoci a̱ma̱ci. Ɗa kpamu o lokoi a̱ma̱ci a, ali n muku n le ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="EZR 10:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10" />
</usx>